Cursor

The pointer is the light "default" arrow from Capitaine cursors, rasterized at 32 px.
Copyright (c) 2016 Keefer Rourke and others.
Capitaine cursors are based on the KDE Breeze icon theme.
License: LGPL-3.0-or-later.
Hotspot: 4, 2 in the original 24 px design, scaled to 5, 2 here.
Source: assets/src/cursor.svg

Icons

House, globe, wifi, and the microphone are from Lucide (not in the Feather set).
The wifi mark is in assets/src/wifi.svg. The microphone is in assets/src/voice.svg.
Copyright (c) 2026 Lucide Icons and Contributors.
License: ISC.

Power, log-out, and rotate-cw are Lucide icons derived from Feather.
Copyright (c) 2013-present Cole Bemis.
License: MIT.

The ISC and MIT notices are below. The rounded plates behind the strip icons
are part of this project and use the same license as the shell, GPL-3.0-or-later.

Network names use an 8x8 bitmap font in src/font8x8.rs.
Those glyphs are public domain (Daniel Hepper, based on the IBM VGA font).

